  "无需注册账号。跨设备可连接自己的 WebDAV；备份不包含 WebDAV 密码、最近搜索或网站图标缓存。": "No account required. Use your own WebDAV to sync devices. Backups exclude WebDAV passwords, search history and icon caches.",
