  "{v0}轻巧的入口": "{v0}A lighter start",
  "{v0}本地的陪伴": "{v0}Local by default",
  "栖页使用独立代码与原创品牌，提供可自由编排的新标签页。桌面、搜索和日常小组件开箱即用；跨设备同步连接你自己的 WebDAV。": "Qiye is an independently built, customizable new tab page. Desktop organization, search and everyday widgets work out of the box. Connect your own WebDAV to sync devices.",
  "图标直接从对应网站加载；低清图标可按设置自动补充公开图标声明，也可主动点击智能提取；自动过程不申请新权限。头像与数据默认保存在本机。启用在线壁纸或天气时，会连接相应服务；启用 WebDAV 后，将桌面同步到你填写的服务。": "Icons load from their websites. Clearer public icons can be fetched automatically or manually; automatic fetching does not request new permissions. Avatars and data stay local by default. Online wallpapers, weather and WebDAV connect to their respective services when enabled.",
  "Copyright © 2026 Ktclat and Qiye contributors. 栖页代码使用 GNU GPLv3，允许使用、修改和按许可证再分发，不提供担保。": "Copyright © 2026 Ktclat and Qiye contributors. Qiye is licensed under GNU GPLv3, allowing use, modification and redistribution under its terms, without warranty.",
  "完整许可证": "Full license",
