  "WebDAV 使用 HTTPS；只有本机 localhost 或 127.0.0.1 的服务可使用 HTTP。": "WebDAV requires HTTPS. HTTP is allowed only for localhost or 127.0.0.1.",
  "同步文件请填写相对于目录的文件名，例如 qiye.json。": "Enter a filename relative to the directory, such as qiye.json.",
