  "请在 WebDAV 设置中点击连接或同步，授予所填网站的访问权限。": "Click Connect or Sync in WebDAV settings to grant site access.",
  "此环境无法保存 WebDAV 本机配置。": "Cannot save local WebDAV configuration in this environment.",
  "WebDAV 本机配置损坏；请清除同步配置后重新填写。": "Local WebDAV configuration is damaged. Clear it and enter it again.",
  "此环境不支持安全同步标识；请在 HTTPS 页面或扩展中打开栖页。": "Secure sync identifiers are unavailable. Open Qiye over HTTPS or as an extension.",
  "此环境不支持安全同步校验；请在 HTTPS 页面或扩展中打开栖页。": "Secure sync validation is unavailable. Open Qiye over HTTPS or as an extension.",
  "WebDAV 验证失败，请检查用户名和密码或应用专用密码。": "WebDAV authentication failed. Check username and password or app password.",
  "WebDAV 拒绝访问，请检查目录与读写权限。": "WebDAV denied access. Check directory and read/write permissions.",
  "该地址不支持所需的 WebDAV 读写方法，请填写实际的 WebDAV 目录。": "This address does not support the required WebDAV methods. Enter the actual WebDAV directory.",
  "同步文件的父目录不存在或不接受此文件；请先在 WebDAV 服务中创建目录。": "The parent directory does not exist or does not accept this file. Create the directory on your WebDAV service first.",
  "WebDAV 服务拒绝了过大的备份文件。": "WebDAV rejected the oversized backup.",
  "WebDAV 文件被锁定，请稍后重试。": "WebDAV file is locked. Retry later.",
  "WebDAV 存储空间不足。": "WebDAV storage is full.",
  "WebDAV 返回 HTTP {v0}，本次操作尚未完成。": "WebDAV returned HTTP {v0}. The operation did not complete.",
  "远程备份超过 6 MiB，已停止读取。": "Remote backup exceeds 6 MiB. Reading stopped.",
  "WebDAV 本机配置格式不正确；请清除同步配置后重新填写。": "Invalid local WebDAV configuration. Clear it and enter it again.",
  "WebDAV 地址发生了重定向。请直接填写最终目录地址；凭据不会转发到新地址。": "WebDAV redirected. Enter the final directory URL directly; credentials are not forwarded.",
  "WebDAV 上传超时，远程写入结果尚未确认；请重新同步以核对，本机数据已保留。": "WebDAV upload timed out; the remote write is unconfirmed. Sync again to check. Local data was kept.",
  "WebDAV 请求超时，请检查服务地址和网络连接。": "WebDAV request timed out. Check the URL and network.",
  "远程文件不是有效的 UTF-8 JSON 备份。": "Remote file is not a valid UTF-8 JSON backup.",
  "WebDAV 上传未能完成确认。请检查网络、证书、重定向和 CORS；网页预览还需服务端允许跨域。远程写入结果未知，请重新同步核对。": "WebDAV upload could not be confirmed. Check network, certificate, redirects and CORS. Remote write status is unknown; sync again to verify.",
  "无法连接 WebDAV。请检查网络、证书和最终目录地址；网页预览还需要服务端允许 CORS，并暴露 ETag 响应头。": "Cannot connect to WebDAV. Check network, certificate and final directory URL. The web version also requires CORS access and an exposed ETag header.",
  "远程文件不是当前格式的栖页备份，或内容未通过校验；两端数据均未替换。": "Remote file is not a valid current-format Qiye backup. Neither desktop was replaced.",
  "远程备份可读取，并提供强 ETag。写入权限将在实际同步时验证。": "Remote backup is readable and provides a strong ETag. Write access will be verified during sync.",
  "远程备份可读取，但缺少可用的强 ETag；可以下载，暂不能安全覆盖上传。网页预览需暴露 ETag 响应头。": "Remote backup is readable but lacks a usable strong ETag. Download is available; safe overwrite is not. The web version requires an exposed ETag header.",
  "服务器返回 404，尚未找到同步文件。请确认目录已存在；首次手动同步会尝试创建文件。此测试未验证写入权限，也未创建文件。": "Server returned 404; no sync file was found. Check that the directory exists. First manual sync will try to create the file. This test did not write or create anything.",
  "同步期间本机内容发生了变化，已停止应用过期快照。请保存后重新同步。": "Local content changed during sync. The stale snapshot was not applied. Save and sync again.",
  "这是本机首次连接该备份，两端内容不同。请先比较并选择保留哪一端。": "This device is connecting to this backup for the first time, and the desktops differ. Compare and choose which to keep.",
  "本机和远程都在上次同步后发生了变化，请比较后选择，当前没有覆盖任何一端。": "Both desktops changed since the last sync. Compare and choose; neither has been overwritten.",
  "远程内容与本机不同，请确认要上传本机版本还是下载远程版本。": "Remote and local content differ. Choose whether to upload local or download remote.",
  "上次同步的远程文件已不存在。请确认后再用本机内容重新创建。": "The remote file from the last sync no longer exists. Confirm before recreating it from local content.",
  "刚才比较的版本已经变化，请重新比较后选择。": "The reviewed versions changed. Compare and choose again.",
  "上传前远程版本已被其他设备更新，条件写入已停止，请重新比较。": "Another device updated the remote file before upload. Conditional write stopped. Compare again.",
  "上传后读回的远程版本与提交内容不同，可能已被其他设备更新。同步结果尚未确认，请比较。": "The read-back differs from the uploaded content, possibly due to another device. Sync is unconfirmed; compare again.",
  "远程备份已读取并校验，请确认后应用到本机。": "Remote backup read and validated. Confirm to apply it locally.",
  "服务端没有提供可用的强 ETag，无法安全覆盖远程文件。请启用 ETag；网页预览需通过 CORS 暴露 ETag 响应头。你仍可下载远程备份。": "Server did not provide a usable strong ETag, so safe overwrite is unavailable. Enable ETags; the web version needs CORS to expose ETag. You can still download the remote backup.",
  "服务器已接受上传，但读回验证未完成。远程写入可能已成功；本机数据已保留，请重新同步核对。": "Server accepted the upload, but read-back verification did not finish. The write may have succeeded. Local data was kept; sync again to check.",
  "本机版本已上传，并已读回验证。": "Local version uploaded and verified by reading it back.",
  "不支持的同步操作。": "Unsupported sync operation.",
  "WebDAV 连接在另一标签已更改，请重新确认。": "WebDAV connection changed in another tab. Confirm again.",
